    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*发麻**。五指从指尖到掌心一齐发麻。右手的右眼——",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九是被肚脐冷醒的。\n他睁开眼。两只眼都看不见——神女昨晚降世时把他震倒在破庙供桌底下。日头从秦淮河水面蒸上来，瓦片烤得发白。他左手按在肚脐上。\n绿疤是凉的。凉"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*钻**出来——在陆九手心",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白豆——从肚脐**钻**出来——在陆九手心**滚**了一圈——**停**了。\n白豆在手心开了花。是**白花**。白花中心有一张脸。是**白小妹的脸**。是白无垢"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*松**了。白花从手心",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的左手**松**了。白花从手心**掉**进红河。\n白花在红河里**变**大——变成一条**粉船**。\n粉色船从红河里**升**起来——升到白无垢面前。\n白无"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生——我母亲——等的是**你**。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "陆九的肚脐**凉**了。\n陆九的肚脐是绿疤——**不**开花的肚脐。\n陆九的肚脐是陆九的肚脐。\n陆九是陆九。\n陆九是**算**不到自己的人。\n陆九是**瞎**眼"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "*给**她",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的嘴说了第五句话：\n\"陆先生——我母亲——等的是**给**她**馒**头的人。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Character"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Character",
    "action_visual": "Character stands still",
    "spoken_dialogue": "陆先生——我母亲——等的是**瞎**眼先生。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Character",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "白无垢的嘴说了第六句话：\n\"陆先生——我母亲——等的是**瞎**眼先生。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
